Maintainer: Stéphane Guerrier <stef.guerrier@gmail.com>
Description: Provides tools for (bio)equivalence assessment in univariate and
    multivariate settings, including finite sample adjustments of the two
    one-sided tests (TOST), quantile equivalence tests and differentially private
    tests. It implements the adjustment procedures proposed in Boulaguiem et al.
    (2024) <doi:10.1002/sim.9993>, Boulaguiem et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.1002/sim.10258> and Insolia et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2507.22756>.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    mvtnorm,
    PowerTOST,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
